[SPEAKER_00] A može postat meko poput

117
00:18:07,860 --> 00:18:11,730
[SPEAKER_00] latice od ruže.

118
00:18:14,190 --> 00:18:26,100
[SPEAKER_00] Al' kad je tvrdo

119
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:43,590
[SPEAKER_00] ne postoji taj

